<title>UK: Cofinoga sets 990 mln French franc 11-year bond.</title>
<headline>Cofinoga sets 990 mln French franc 11-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Nationale de Paris.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COFINOGA</p>
<p> AMT    990 MLN FFR   COUPON     6.60 PCT  MATURITY    18.OCT.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.599   PAY DATE    18.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70 PCT  REOFFER    99.299    SPREAD	+44 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A3	  LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K) FIVE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED CURVE BETWEEN THE OCTOBER 2006 OAT AND THE OCTOBER 2008 OAT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
